      "text_raw": "To obtain the actual values\nwe have to find the loop\ngain LG first.\nThe loop is broken at the\noutput of the opamp. The\ninput voltage v is set to\nIN\nzero.\nThe loop gain LG is the\nratio of the output voltage\nv to the input voltage\nOUTLG\nv . It is easily found to\nINLG\nbe the open loop gain A\n0\ndivided by the closed-loop\ngain A .\nv\nThe loop gain LG is now\nquite large indeed, since A\n0\nis so large.",
